ues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"There is a false positive `array-bounds` error (due to agressive -O3 optimization in release build) is\r\nfixed in slice_transform_test.cc\r\n\r\n```\r\nIn file included from src/yb/rocksdb/slice_transform.h:34:0,\r\n                 from src/yb/rocksdb/util/slice_transform_test.cc:24:\r\nsrc/yb/util/slice.h: In member function ‘virtual void rocksdb::SliceTransformTest_CapPrefixTransform_Test::TestBody()’:\r\nsrc/yb/util/slice.h:64:57: error: array subscript is below array bounds [-Werror=array-bounds]\r\n   Slice(const uint8_t* d, size_t n) : begin_(d), end_(d + n) {}\r\n```\r\n\r\nUsing `Slice(const std::string&)` constructor instead of `Slice()` or `Slice(const char* s)` for \"\" (empty string) solves the issue.\r\nProblem is very specific for this particular place. There is no issue with creation of Slice from \"\" all the time.","closed_by":{"login":"d-uspenskiy","id":47734295,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzM0Mjk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47734295?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy","html_url":"https://github.com/d-uspenskiy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"rea